---
description: Global English Tutor Agent project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read `AGENTS.md` before modifying files.
- Treat the PRD as the product source of truth.
- Implement one task card at a time.
- Before editing, state the plan and expected changed files.
- Do not silently change product rules, architecture decisions, API contracts or database semantics.
- Prefer a minimal working vertical slice over broad scaffolding.
- Do not add unapproved dependencies.
- Update tests and affected documentation in the same task.
- Never commit secrets, real user audio, tokens or private conversation data.
